{"ID":"20240220132638-a7m3s7a","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132638-a7m3s7a","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132638-a7m3s7a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312161104-s639drb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312161052-z4203jh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312161104-0bqxb9r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【麻杏甘石汤】（麻黄杏仁甘草石膏汤）","type":"doc","updated":"20240312161104"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312161104-s639drb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161104-s639drb","updated":"20240312161104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第六十八条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161104-dj15rs7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161104-dj15rs7","updated":"20240312161104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：发汗后,不可更行「桂枝汤」。汗出而喘,无大热者,可与「麻黄杏仁甘草石膏汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161104-rb9vgt2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161104-rb9vgt2","updated":"20240312161104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当发汗以后，病人出汗了，不要再给他桂枝汤。当你发汗以后，病人很好，就是还有点咳嗽，喘，短气的现象或者咳嗽的现象。这个时候没有大热了，因为热已经退掉了，桂枝汤、麻黄汤、葛根汤都可以去热，小孩子发烧，大青龙、小青龙都可以去热。看发烧是什么病，再决定给他。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"没有大热了，就可以吃麻杏甘石汤（麻黄杏仁甘草石膏汤）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161104-j74ar1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161104-j74ar1z","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312161104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄杏仁甘草石膏汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312161104-nw2hy1v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161104-nw2hy1v","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312161104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄四两去节，杏仁五十个去皮尖，甘草二两，石膏半斤打碎绵囊。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312161104-cf55kfx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161104-cf55kfx","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312161104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右四味,以水七升,先煮麻黄减二升,去上沬,纳诸药,煮取二升,去滓,温服一升。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312161104-2w03lxs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161104-2w03lxs","updated":"20240312161104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麻杏甘石汤虽然有麻黄，但吃麻杏甘石汤并不会发汗。是很有名治疗气喘的方剂。可以用。黄金比例，麻黄三钱，杏仁两钱，石膏五钱、六钱都没有关系，这个跟大青龙、小青龙不一样哦，大青龙麻黄比如说六钱，杏仁开两钱，石膏开四钱，四加二正好跟麻黄相等，绝对不会伤到津液，比例就是这样子。石膏目的是去热。麻杏甘石汤的石膏也是去热，杏仁是祛痰、润肺。因为他没有大热，所以麻杏甘石汤，跟大青龙不一样，我们不需要靠麻黄来发表、出汗，所以麻黄剂量不用很多。大青龙的时候，病人有高烧，有时候咳的呼吸呼不过来。SAS 就是这种大青龙汤症，你处方麻黄剂量不够，明明是大青龙可以治好，可是你手软处方不够，病人死掉了，所以那个时候下手要重，不要怕，就是比例。这个人如果高烧很重，咳嗽，痰不多，石膏用到五钱，麻黄还是六钱，杏仁一钱。如果说痰比较多，烧没有那么多，石膏用两钱，杏仁用四钱。可以加减，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"但是石膏与杏仁合起来的剂量一定要与麻黄剂量等。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个麻杏甘石汤本身没有大热，所以不用担心。也就是说，如果病人发烧，结果你开出来的却是麻杏甘石汤，你开错处方了。因为麻杏甘石汤不是要治疗发烧的。所以病人发汗以后，有喘的现象就开麻杏甘石汤。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"煮的时候也是一样，先煮麻黄。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312161104-zvmff7p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161104-zvmff7p","updated":"20240312161104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"开汤剂，有时你不知道时机怎么用，因为你们现在没有经验，等你们学完以后，用过一次从此就记得了。不是很难。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161104-0bqxb9r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161104-0bqxb9r"}},{"ID":"20240312161051-5ppglfz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161051-5ppglfz","updated":"20240312161051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一百七十七条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161051-94t3bi5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161051-94t3bi5","updated":"20240312161051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：下后,不可更行「桂枝汤」；若汗出而喘,无大热者,可与「麻黄杏仁甘草石膏汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161051-42wznur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161051-42wznur","updated":"20240312161051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「麻黄杏仁甘草石膏汤」使用时机是汗出而喘，这个喘可以跟咳连在一起。病人咳嗽气喘，舌头黄的，里面是热。「麻黄杏仁甘草石膏汤」是热症，没有发烧，不怕热，也不难过，有汗，就问完了，「麻黄杏仁甘草石膏汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161051-lqkbpp5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161051-lqkbpp5","updated":"20240312161051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果麻杏甘石汤，病人无汗大热的时候，就变成大青龙汤，大青龙汤就是来自麻杏甘石汤。麻杏甘石汤加上桂枝生姜红枣，七味药组合就变成大青龙。大青龙汤一定是无汗而喘，有热有咳。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161051-0i0kknt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161051-0i0kknt","updated":"20240312161051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人气喘咳嗽，舌头是黄的，没有汗，身体痛，还有发烧，这个时候要用大青龙汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161051-ioegdc4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161051-ioegdc4","updated":"20240312161051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床，病人一到夏天就开始喘，不用问了，大青龙汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161051-2ed2q9n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161051-2ed2q9n","updated":"20240312161051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果被攻下了，不要开桂枝汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。肠胃津液伤到了，你桂枝汤再下去，肠胃的津液又没了，里面就干掉了，就是担心这个。所以才说不可更行桂枝汤，就是怕津液一伤再伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161051-d6lrl7c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161051-d6lrl7c","updated":"20240312161051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果病人是长期的便秘，本来便秘就很久了，你攻下去以后，张仲景也说积下成阴，一攻下以后，他大便清出来，津液回头，本来燥渴，津液回头，这个时候得到桂枝汤症你还是可以用桂枝汤，因为他没有伤到津液。伤到津液的时候就要小心。"}]},{"ID":"20240312161052-qpv1ua9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161052-qpv1ua9"}},{"ID":"20240312161052-z4203jh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312161052-z4203jh"}}]}